                                       <field name=\\"relation_field\\" invisible=\\"ttype != 'one2many' or related or compute\\" readonly=\\"ttype != 'one2many'\\" required=\\"ttype == 'one2many' and not related and not compute\\"/>\\n                                                    <field name=\\"relation_table\\" groups=\\"base.group_no_one\\" invisible=\\"ttype != 'many2many' or state != 'manual'\\" readonly=\\"ttype != 'many2many' or state != 'manual'\\"/>\\n                                                    <field name=\\"column1\\" groups=\\"base.group_no_one\\" invisible=\\"ttype != 'many2many' or state != 'manual'\\" readonly=\\"ttype != 'many2many' or state != 'manual'\\"/>\\n                                                    <field name=\\"column2\\" groups=\\"base.group_no_one\\" invisible=\\"ttype != 'many2many' or state != 'manual'\\" readonly=\\"ttype != 'many2many' or state != 'manual'\\"/>\\n                                                    <field name=\\"domain\\" groups=\\"base.group_no_one\\" invisible=\\"ttype not in ['many2one', 'one2many', 'many2many']\\" readonly=\\"ttype not in ['many2one', 'one2many', 'many2many']\\"/>\\n                                                </group>\\n                                            </group>\\n                                            <group invisible=\\"ttype not in ['selection', 'reference']\\" readonly=\\"ttype not in ['selection', 'reference']\\">\\n                                                <field name=\\"selection_ids\\">\\n                                                    <list editable=\\"bottom\\">\\n                                                        <field name=\\"sequence\\" widget=\\"handle\\"/>\\n                                                        <field name=\\"value\\"/>\\n                                                        <field name=\\"name\\"/>\\n                                                    </list>\\n                                                </field>\\n                                            </group>\\n                                        </page>\\n                                        <page name=\\"compute\\" string=\\"Calcular\\" groups=\\"base.group_no_one\\" invisible=\\"ttype == 'one2many' and relation_field\\">\\n                                            <group>\\n                                                <field name=\\"related\\"/>\\n                                                <field name=\\"depends\\" required=\\"compute not in [False, '']\\"/>\\n                                                <field name=\\"compute\\" widget=\\"code\\" options=\\"{'mode': 'python'}\\"/>\\n                                            </group>\\n                                            <div>\\n                                                <h3>Cómo definir un campo calculado</h3>\\n                                                <p>Los campos calculados son definidos con los campos\\n                                                <strong>Dependencias</strong> y <strong>Calcular</strong>.</p>\\n                                                <p>El campo <strong>Dependencias</strong> enlista los campos de los que\\n                                                depende el campo actual. Es una lista de nombres de campos\\n                                                separados por comas, como <code>nombre, tamaño</code>. También se puede referir a \\n                                                campos accesibles a través de otros campos relacionales, por ejemplo\\n                                                <code>partner_id.company_id.name</code>.</p>\\n                                                <p>El campo <strong>Calcular</strong> es el código Python\\n                                                para calcular el valor del campo en un conjunto de registros. El valor del\\n                                                campo debe asignarse a cada registro con una asignación\\n                                                como de diccionario.</p>\\n                                                <pre>\\n    para registrar en self:\\n        record['size'] = len(record.name)\\n</pre>\\n                                                <p>Las únicas variables predefinidas</p>\\n                                                <ul>\\n                                                    <li><code>self</code> (el conjunto de registros para calcular)</li>\\n                                                    <li><code>datetime</code> (Módulo Python)</li>\\n                                                    <li><code>dateutil</code> (Módulo Python)</li>\\n                                                    <li><code>time</code> (Módulo Python)</li>\\n                                                </ul>\\n                                                <p>Se puede acceder a otras funciones a través de <code>self</code>, como\\n<code>self.env</code>, etc.</p>\\n                                            </div>\\n                                        </page>\\n                                        <page name=\\"groups\\" string=\\"Permisos de acceso\\">\\n                                            <field name=\\"groups\\"/>\\n                                        </page>\\n                                    </notebook>\\n                                </form>\\n                            </field>\\n                            <button groups=\\"base.group_no_one\\" icon=\\"format_align_justify\\" name=\\"2\\" string=\\"Crear un menú\\" type=\\"action\\" target=\\"new\\"/>\\n                        </page>\\n                        <page string=\\"Permisos de acceso\\" name=\\"access_rights\\">\\n                            <field name=\\"access_ids\\">\\n                                <list string=\\"Permisos de acceso\\" editable=\\"top\\" decoration-warning=\\"not group_id and operation\\">\\n                                    <field name=\\"kind\\"/>\\n                                    <field name=\\"name\\"/>\\n                                    <field name=\\"group_id\\" readonly=\\"is_standard\\"/>\\n                                    <field name=\\"for_create\\" readonly=\\"is_standard\\"/>\\n                                    <field name=\\"for_read\\" readonly=\\"is_standard\\"/>\\n                                    <field name=\\"for_write\\" readonly=\\"is_standard\\"/>\\n                                    <field name=\\"for_unlink\\" readonly=\\"is_standard\\"/>\\n                                    <field name=\\"operation\\" column_invisible=\\"1\\"/> <!-- field is necessary for create() -->\\n                                    <field name=\\"domain\\" readonly=\\"is_standard\\"/>\\n                                    <button name=\\"customize\\" type=\\"object\\" invisible=\\"not is_standard\\" string=\\"Customize\\" help=\\"Duplicate this access to customize it\\"/>\\n                                </list>\\n                            </field>\\n                        </page>\\n                        <page string=\\"Notas\\" name=\\"notes\\" groups=\\"base.group_no_one\\">\\n                            <separator string=\\"Información\\"/>\\n                            <field name=\\"info\\"/>\\n                        </page>\\n                        <page string=\\"Vistas\\" name=\\"views\\" groups=\\"base.group_no_one\\">\\n                            <field name=\\"view_ids\\"/>\\n                        </page>\\n                    </notebook>\\n                  </sheet>\\n                </form>"}	<?xml version="1.0"?>\n<form string="Model Description" duplicate="0">\n                  <header><!-- used for override --></header>\n                  <sheet>\n                    <div class="oe_title">\n                        <label for="name"/>\n                        <h1>\n                            <field name="name" placeholder="e.g. Sales Order"/>\n                        </h1>\n                    </div>\n                    <group>\n                        <field name="explanation" placeholder="Provide a verbose explanation of the model's purpose..."/>\n                    </group>\n                    <group>\n                        <group>\n                            <field name="model" readonly="id"/>\n                            <field name="order"/>\n                            <field name="abstract" readonly="id" groups="base.group_no_one"/>\n                            <field name="transient" readonly="id" groups="base.group_no_one"/>\n                        </group>\n                        <group>\n                            <field name="state" readonly="1" groups="base.group_no_one"/>\n                            <field name="modules" groups="base.group_no_one"/>\n                        </group>\n                    </group>\n                    <notebook>\n                        <page string="Fields" name="fields">\n                            <field name="field_id">\n                                <list string="Fields Description">\n                                    <field name="name"/>\n                                    <field name="field_description"/>\n                                    <field name="ttype"/>\n                                    <field name="required"/>\n                                    <field name="readonly"/>\n                                    <field name="index" groups="base.group_no_one"/>\n                                    <field name="state" groups="base.group_no_one"/>\n                                </list>\n                                <form string="Fields Description">\n                                    <group>\n                                        <group>\n                                            <field name="name"/>\n                                            <field name="field_description"/>\n                                        </group>\n                                        <group>\n                                            <field name="ttype"/>\n                                            <field name="help"/>\n                                        </group>\n                                    </group>\n                                    <notebook>\n                                        <page name="base" string="Properties">\n                                            <group>\n                                                <group>\n                                                    <field name="required"/>\n                                                    <field name="readonly"/>\n                                                    <field name="store" groups="base.group_no_one"/>\n                                                    <field name="allowed_index_types" invisible="1"/>\n                                                    <!-- necessary for the widget's option -->\n                                                    <field name="index" groups="base.group_no_one" widget="filterable_selection" options="{'whitelist_fname': 'allowed_index_types'}" readonly="state != 'manual'"/>\n                                                    <field name="copied" groups="base.group_no_one"/>\n                                                    <field name="state" groups="base.group_no_one"/>\n                                                    <field name="modules" groups="base.group_no_one"/>\n                                                </group>\n                                                <group>\n                                                    <field name="translate" invisible="ttype not in ['char', 'text', 'html']" readonly="ttype not in ['char', 'text', 'html']"/>\n                                                    <field name="size" groups="base.group_no_one" invisible="ttype not in ['char', 'reference']" readonly="ttype not in ['char', 'reference']"/>\n                                                    <field name="relation" invisible="ttype not in ['many2one', 'one2many', 'many2many']" readonly="ttype not in ['many2one', 'one2many', 'many2many']" required="ttype in ['many2one', 'one2many', 'many2many']"/>\n                                                    <field name="on_delete" groups="base.group_no_one" invisible="ttype != 'many2one'" readonly="ttype != 'many2one'"/>\n                                                    <field name="relation_field" invisible="ttype != 'one2many' or related or compute" readonly="ttype != 'one2many'" required="ttype == 'one2many' and not related and not compute"/>\n                                                    <field name="relation_table" groups="base.group_no_one" invisible="ttype != 'many2many' or state != 'manual'" readonly="ttype != 'many2many' or state != 'manual'"/>\n                                                    <field name="column1" groups="base.group_no_one" invisible="ttype != 'many2many' or state != 'manual'" readonly="ttype != 'many2many' or state != 'manual'"/>\n                                                    <field name="column2" groups="base.group_no_one" invisible="ttype != 'many2many' or state != 'manual'" readonly="ttype != 'many2many' or state != 'manual'"/>\n                                                    <field name="domain" groups="base.group_no_one" invisible="ttype not in ['many2one', 'one2many', 'many2many']" readonly="ttype not in ['many2one', 'one2many', 'many2many']"/>\n                                                </group>\n                                            </group>\n                                            <group invisible="ttype not in ['selection', 'reference']" readonly="ttype not in ['selection', 'reference']">\n                                                <field name="selection_ids">\n                                                    <list editable="bottom">\n                                                        <field name="sequence" widget="handle"/>\n                                                        <field name="value"/>\n                                                        <field name="name"/>\n                                                    </list>\n                                                </field>\n                                            </group>\n                                        </page>\n                                        <page name="compute" string="Compute" groups="base.group_no_one" invisible="ttype == 'one2many' and relation_field">\n                                            <group>\n                                                <field name="related"/>\n                                                <field name="depends" required="compute not in [False, '']"/>\n                                                <field name="compute" widget="code" options="{'mode': 'python'}"/>\n                                            </group>\n                                            <div>\n                                                <h3>How to define a computed field</h3>\n                                                <p>Computed fields are defined with the fields\n                                                <strong>Dependencies</strong> and <strong>Compute</strong>.</p>\n                                                <p>The field <strong>Dependencies</strong> lists the fields that\n                                                the current field depends on. It is a comma-separated list of\n                                                field names, like <code>name, size</code>. You can also refer to\n                                                fields accessible through other relational fields, for instance\n                                                <code>partner_id.company_id.name</code>.</p>\n                                                <p>The field <strong>Compute</strong> is the Python code to\n                                                compute the value of the field on a set of records. The value of\n                                                the field must be assigned to each record with a dictionary-like\n                                                assignment.</p>\n                                                <pre>\n    for record in self:\n        record['size'] = len(record.name)\n</pre>\n                                                <p>The only predefined variables are</p>\n                                                <ul>\n                                                    <li><code>self</code> (the set of records to compute)</li>\n                                                    <li><code>datetime</code> (Python module)</li>\n                                                    <li><code>dateutil</code> (Python module)</li>\n                                                    <li><code>time</code> (Python module)</li>\n                                                </ul>\n                                                <p>Other features are accessible through <code>self</code>, like\n                                                <code>self.env</code>, etc.</p>\n                                            </div>\n                                        </page>\n                                        <page name="groups" string="Access Rights">\n                                            <field name="groups"/>\n                                        </page>\n                                    </notebook>\n                                </form>\n                            </field>\n                            <button groups="base.group_no_one" icon="format_align_justify" name="2" string="Create a Menu" type="action" target="new"/>\n                        </page>\n                        <page string="Access Rights" name="access_rights">\n                            <field name="access_ids">\n                                <list string="Access Rights" editable="top" decoration-warning="not group_id and operation">\n                                    <field name="kind"/>\n                                    <field name="name"/>\n                                    <field name="group_id" readonly="is_standard"/>\n                                    <field name="for_create" readonly="is_standard"/>\n                                    <field name="for_read" readonly="is_standard"/>\n                                    <field name="for_write" readonly="is_standard"/>\n                                    <field name="for_unlink" readonly="is_standard"/>\n                                    <field name="operation" column_invisible="1"/> <!-- field is necessary for create() -->\n                                    <field name="domain" readonly="is_standard"/>\n                                    <button name="customize" type="object" invisible="not is_standard" string="Customize" help="Duplicate this access to customize it"/>\n                                </list>\n                            </field>\n                        </page>\n                        <page string="Notes" name="notes" groups="base.group_no_one">\n                            <separator string="Information"/>\n                            <field name="info"/>\n                        </page>\n                        <page string="Views" name="views" groups="base.group_no_one">\n                            <field name="view_ids"/>\n                        </page>\n                    </notebook>\n                  </sheet>\n                </form>\n            	\N	f	t	2026-11-20 12:08:09.824566	2026-11-20 12:08:09.824566
